      "created_at": "2014-09-05T21:11:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I picked up the Smash Up \"Big Geeky Box\" yesterday.&nbsp; It's very well done, with sturdy rows, thick plastic dividers between the decks, and foam blocks...Lots of foam blocks.&nbsp; I'm not saying &gt;G should put out something like that it for SotM.&nbsp; I'm just saying that it's really pretty.&nbsp; Or maybe I'm saying they should in a passive aggressive sort of way.</p><p>Make the box! :-)</p><p>Ben&nbsp;</p>",
