      "id": 117109,
      "name": "Snail Shell",
      "username": "Snail_Shell",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/eada6e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-06T05:09:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I disagree.&nbsp; Here's why.</p><p>Gaming meetup a couple of weeks ago, the other guys were talking about how much stuff you get in the box with Terra Mystica and how heavy the box was.</p><p>WHUDD!!</p><p>I drop SotM on the table, getting intimidated looks from the other guys at my table, and 'what was that??' looks from other tables.&nbsp;</p><p>Then I did the same with the second box.&nbsp; :D</p><p>Needless to say, I explained to them what SotM was, why it was so dense and heavy, and then instructed a game where we proudly made Ambuscade cry uncle.</p><p>The stares of awe are WAY too much fun to pack this whole game into one box.&nbsp; :)</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:49:42.499Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
