    {
      "id": 117115,
      "name": "BenjaminTodd",
      "username": "BenjaminTodd",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ecc23a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-07T05:05:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can picture the WotC expansion and maybe one more fitting into EE and Vengeance.&nbsp; It would be tight.&nbsp; Right now I have it split with Villians in Vengence and heros and evironments in the EE Box.&nbsp; I still have space for the WotC expansion, though I'm not sure about beyond.</p><p>That said, I'd rather have just one box that holds everything.&nbsp; I just prefer to have everything there.&nbsp; Since I had the time, I carded up the Smash Up box with my SotM set.&nbsp; I have every expansion released and all of the standard cards fit with a significant amount of space left over.&nbsp; You can see it below.&nbsp; Add an inch, maybe rotate the orientation of the box dividers and I think you could have a really good layout carrying the game.</p><p>Ben</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>http://www.scigasm.com/CardedUp.jpg</p>",
