      "raw": "<p>I can picture the WotC expansion and maybe one more fitting into EE and Vengeance.&nbsp; It would be tight.&nbsp; Right now I have it split with Villians in Vengence and heros and evironments in the EE Box.&nbsp; I still have space for the WotC expansion, though I&#39;m not sure about beyond.</p><p>That said, I&#39;d rather have just one box that holds everything.&nbsp; I just prefer to have everything there.&nbsp; Since I had the time, I carded up the Smash Up box with my SotM set.&nbsp; I have every expansion released and all of the standard cards fit with a significant amount of space left over.&nbsp; You can see it below.&nbsp; Add an inch, maybe rotate the orientation of the box dividers and I think you could have a really good layout carrying the game.</p><p>Ben</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.scigasm.com/CardedUp.jpg\" /></p><p>http://www.scigasm.com/CardedUp.jpg</p>",
