      "id": 117121,
      "name": "Renkenr",
      "username": "Renkenr",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/9d8465/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-09T15:52:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Now try fitting everything into the boxes after you sleeve your cards.</p><p>Had to remove part of the insert to the EE box and they still didn't fit. 1/4th of a millimeter over. RC/IR was perfect for holding sleeved cards. The Vengence box has a lot of space wasted on the oversized cards holder area, but holds sleeved cards perfectly in the normal card areas.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(side bar: yes. I sleeve. Having destroyed cards from use in CCGs because we didn't know any better in 1994 and now seeing those cards values... That's why I sleeve. If you don't sleeve that's your choice. I love SotM and I want to keep my cards around for a looong time. Glad it's not a CCG!)</p>",
